n the local multiplayer mode and battle on 1 of the five stages.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/9a78e711f0fde8525482644c6d91c6b9.avif?t=1736129573\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles through the main story\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Bosses through Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the different city boroughs and collect items to progress the story.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against friends in the Local Multiplayer Battle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
